        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The hash value is stored from address 20 and comprises 20 bytes of data. The hash is formed from sha1 (EPC-ID + EVID + TagID + Salt) and is used for the validation and copy protection of a tag. The TagID is unique and write-protected ex works for each tag.",
